  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gal 502.10 “Writing” means a hard-copy paper document, an e-mail, a facsimile transmission, or an electronic communication of words in other than an oral format, which can be printed onto paper.\n\nSource. #8941, eff 9-15-07, EXPIRED: 9-15-15\n\nNew. #11075, INTERIM, eff 4-18-16, EXPIRED: 10-15-16\n\nNew. #12010, eff 10-21-16",
